   "fix": "Move the corollary to a downstream file in the smooth-knot area, e.g. a new `TauCeti/KnotTheory/` module that imports both `Polygon.Inscribed` and `SmoothCircle`/`SmoothEmbedding.Basic`. Then delete lines 13\u201314 from `Polygon/Inscribed.lean`, so the file keeps only the calculus imports it needs for the generic `C\u00b9` result.",
